# Notifier Component

Multi-channel notification publisher that distributes monitoring events to Discord, Telegram, and Email destinations.

## Key Integration Pattern
Implements adapter pattern with Source interface for extensible notification channels, supporting group-based filtering and concurrent publishing.

## Important Constraints
- All sources must implement graceful context cancellation and timeout handling
- Each notification channel exposes its own Prometheus metrics for delivery tracking
- Sources are created via factory pattern with automatic configuration validation